# chest sample exclude list: one pattern per line.
# Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored.
# Patterns use tar --exclude syntax (wildcards allowed).
#
# Copy to ~/.config/chest/excludes (picked up automatically), or pass it with:
#   chest backup --exclude-file /path/to/excludes
#
# - No file                 -> built-in default excludes are used
# - File with patterns      -> these patterns REPLACE the built-in defaults
# - File without patterns   -> no exclusions are used (a warning is printed)
# Patterns passed with -e on the command line are always added on top.

.cache
node_modules
Downloads
*.iso
.steam
VirtualBox VMs
